on validation in one method. The inline composition adds a new, more branchy concern (not just a `normalize` call like before) to that method; extracting it per the above keeps the step from accreting further.\n\nEverything else \u2014 the entity getters/setters, `ApplyOwner` mapping, the four schema files, and the OpenAPI doc (including dropping `address` from `required`) \u2014 is additive and idiomatic."
